      "evidence_kind": "api_reference",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 70,
        "end_line": 116
      },
      "excerpt": "API:\ntorch.mm\n\n\nInput:\n2D tensors\n\n\ndtype:\ntorch.bool\n\n\ndevice:\nmps\n\n\nOperation:\n\ntorch.mm(input, mat2)\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nReproduction\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nimport torch\n\na = torch.randint(\n    0,\n    2,\n    (4,4),\n    dtype=torch.bool,\n    device=\"mps\"\n)\n\nb = torch.randint(\n    0,\n    2,\n    (4,4),\n    dtype=torch.bool,\n    device=\"mps\"\n)\n\ntorch.mm(a,b)\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------",
      "attribution": {
        "actor": null,
        "actor_role": "reporter"
      },
      "content_hash": "sha256:0047e0150c40939cb6fb1d94d8ba3779286eecaa859afc4f4107e5640fc7be6e"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev_art_primary_report_expected_behavior_dcb1e0c04d26",
      "source_artifact_ref": "art_primary_report",
      "evidence_kind": "expected_behavior",
      "locator": {
        "locator_type": "line_range",
        "start_line": 127,
        "end_line": 145
      },
      "excerpt": "Expected Behavior\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nThe operation should reject unsupported dtype\nwith a clear error message, similar to CPU behavior.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nRoot Cause Hint\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nBackend dispatch lacks proper dtype validation\nbefore entering MPS matmul implementation.\n\n\n--------------------------------------------------\nPotential Bug Pattern\n--------------------------------------------------\n",
      "attribution": {
